  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">A valid `TRIAGE-EMAIL` `sprk_analysisaction` JPS definition exists (prompted) producing `{category, summary(2-line), obligations[], priority, reviewOutcome}`, and passes `jps-validate` (schema + render).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The `category` output is resolvable against the 013 taxonomy and `reviewOutcome` uses the D-05 closed value set (not "disposition").</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The Action is authored to reuse the existing classification signal (`AiClassificationRung`/`CommunicationClassificationResult`) — its instruction/inputs do NOT re-run a full classification pass.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">NEGATIVE: the capability lands on the closed catalog (ADR-039 Action + Binding), NOT the frozen node-graph engine / `IInvokePlaybookAi`; the Action definition references no `IOpenAiClient`/`IPlaybookService` internals.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">NEGATIVE: this task authors ONLY the Action definition — no Binding, input/output schema, eval case, RAG wiring, or enrichment trigger (those are task 023).</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

